# ---------------------------------------------------------- the shop itself --
# The counter's own runtime state, and none of it belongs in a public repo:
#   results/shop/auth_accounts.json     a password hash
#   results/shop/auth_sessions.json     live session tokens
#   results/shop/customer_invites.json  live single-use customer credentials
#   results/shop/orders/                real names and phone numbers
#   results/scans/                      ~6,000 frames of what the camera saw
#   results/audit.jsonl                 the money chain, with gateway payment ids
# All of it is REGENERABLE: `tools/seed_shop.py` builds a whole shop and
# `tools/real_photos.py` dresses it. A repo carries the counter, not the shop.
results/
